meta:
  origin:
    producer: IRENA
    title: Renewable Energy Patents
    description: |-
      Data on renewable energy patents.
      This dataset provides comprehensive, but by no means exhaustive information on patents filed for renewable energy worldwide.
      Data for the most recent years are not complete due to a lag between the filing date and the time at which the patents are officially published.
      Further information can be found on [IRENA INSPIRE](https://inspire.irena.org/).
    citation_full: |-
      International Renewable Energy Agency (IRENA) INSPIRE Platform (2026). Available at: https://inspire.irena.org/

      Data are based on EPO PATSTAT and on the Climate Change Mitigation Technologies (Y02) classification by EPO.
    attribution: IRENA - INSPIRE Platform (2026)
    attribution_short: IRENA
    url_main: https://www.irena.org/Data/View-data-by-topic/Innovation-and-Technology/Patents-Evolution
